From {{der|en|enm|hoden}}, {{m|enm|hodien}}, from {{der|en|ang|hādian||to ordain, consecrate}}, from {{der|en|ang|hād||rank, order, office, holy office}}. See above.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|en|hode}}

====Verb====
{{en-verb|had}}

# {{lb|en|transitive|obsolete}} To [[ordain]]; [[consecrate]]; [[admit]] to a religious order.

